      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait lol... goblins? i'm just trying to buy a condo, i didn't realize it was a fantasy game. can you just explain the actual legal part of it without the metaphors? like, who exactly is holding the money and how can i be sure they won't just lose it or something?",
